<title>UK: Cazenove Indian GDR index firms on Bombay rally.</title>
<headline>Cazenove Indian GDR index firms on Bombay rally.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cazenove Indian GDR index was 0.90 points or 1.16 percent up on Wednesday at 78.85 after blue chip share prices staged a late rally to a stronger close on the Bombay Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
